        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 304.46,
          "end": 306.563,
          "en": "It's the same here for Native apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 307.44,
          "end": 310.61,
          "en": "So that's what we do with those components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 310.61,
          "end": 312.6,
          "en": "Of course, another important aspect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 312.6,
          "end": 316.11,
          "en": "of building user interfaces in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 316.11,
          "end": 319.43,
          "en": "is that you wanna style those apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 319.43,
          "end": 324.11,
          "en": "And when using React Native, there is no CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 324.11,
          "end": 326.46,
          "en": "You can't write CSS code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 326.46,
          "end": 328.4,
          "en": "because again, it's not a browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 328.4,
          "end": 331.313,
          "en": "so the CSS language doesn't exist here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 332.45,
          "end": 335.81,
          "en": "Instead, you can, of course, still apply Styles,",
