          "en": "which are similar to the CSS properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 374.06,
          "end": 375.54,
          "en": "But it's only a subset",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 375.54,
          "end": 379.26,
          "en": "of the overall CSS property and feature set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 379.26,
          "end": 380.944,
          "en": "But in the end, as you will learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 380.944,
          "end": 381.87,
          "en": "throughout this Course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 381.87,
          "end": 385,
          "en": "you get all the important CSS properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 385,
          "end": 386.94,
          "en": "and features that you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 386.94,
          "end": 390.363,
          "en": "to build powerful and beautiful user interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
